# Safe, committed template: variable names and empty/placeholder values only.
# This demo currently requires no environment variables.
# Add new required variables here when adding a server-side integration.
# API_BASE_URL=https://cam-trip.cheat.casa/api   # optional; defaults to the teacher CamTrip API
# Never put real credentials in this file, including in comments.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ values are exposed to browsers; never use that prefix for secrets.
#
# Optional: base URL of the public CamTrip API used by the About page.
# Defaults to https://cam-trip.cheat.casa when unset.
# CAMTRIP_API_BASE_URL=https://cam-trip.cheat.casa

